"此项目存在于本地，但尚未纳入 SVN 版本控制，没有可比较的仓库基准版本。\n\n需要提交时，先勾选并点击“添加到 SVN”；添加只安排版本控制，提交后才会上传。添加目录不会自动添加子文件。\n\n不需要提交的本地文件可以保留原状。" = "This item exists locally but is not under SVN version control, so there is no repository base version to compare.\n\nTo commit it, select it and click Add to SVN first. Adding schedules version control; files are uploaded only when committed. Adding a directory does not automatically add its files.\n\nLocal files that do not need to be committed can stay as they are.";
"此项目匹配 SVN 忽略规则，未纳入版本控制，不会列入添加或提交候选。\n\n规则可能来自本应用的全局忽略设置、系统 SVN 配置或目录忽略属性。需要添加时，请先调整对应规则并刷新。已受版本控制的文件不受忽略规则影响。" = "This item matches SVN ignore rules and is not versioned. It is excluded from add and commit candidates.\n\nRules may come from this app's global ignores, system SVN configuration, or directory properties. To add the item, adjust the relevant rules and refresh first. Ignore rules do not affect versioned files.";
